<title>USA: First South Africa Corp Ltd year loss.</title>
<headline>First South Africa Corp Ltd year loss.</headline>
<dateline>COCONUT GROVE, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>year-end	  1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.34   profit	 $0.51</p>
<p> Net loss		  $4,523   profit	$1,722</p>
<p> Revs		     $36,907		  $33,063</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 3,374		    3,374</p>
<p>(all data above 000s except per share number)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 net includes extraordinary charges of $6,710,500, of which $6,314,000 came from a non-cash compensation charge relating to the release of 1.1 million shares from an agreement between the company and certain of its shareholders and $396,500 was an imputed non-operating interest charge attributed to the company's November 1995 bridge note financing.</p>
